 "replacements": [],
 "public_instruction": "Locate and cross-sort the eight misplaced household items across the Central Study, West Bedroom, and East Bedroom, wipe the dusty furniture and study laptop, vacuum both bedroom floors once cleared, set the bedroom lamps and study laptop to their required states, and return both cleaning tools.",
 "public_context": [
  "Clean and reset the upstairs furniture and lighting across the Central Study, West Bedroom, and East Bedroom using the cleaning cloth on the serving cart and the floor vacuum in the North Utility Bathroom: switch the Central Study desk laptop off before wiping dust off it, wipe dust off the Central Study laptop, the Central Study bookcase, the tall Central Study storage cabinet (along the north wall west of the bookcase), the West Bedroom desk, the West Bedroom nightstand, and the East Bedroom nightstand, and switch the Central Study laptop back on while leaving both the West Bedroom nightstand table lamp and East Bedroom nightstand table lamp switched off; after clearing all misplaced items off the West Bedroom floor and East Bedroom floor, vacuum the dust off both bedroom floors; and return the cleaning cloth to the North Utility Bathroom serving cart and leave the floor vacuum switched off on the North Utility Bathroom floor.",
  "Locate the eight openly visible misplaced household items distributed across the beds, tables, and floors of the Central Study, West Bedroom, and East Bedroom—a bottle of water, a baseball cap, a teddy bear, a bottle of lotion, an alarm clock, a box of tissues, a hardback book, and a digital camera—and sort every item to its proper home (wiping dusty destination surfaces before placing items on or inside them): place the teddy bear and baseball cap onto the East Bedroom bed; place the bottle of lotion and bottle of water onto the wiped East Bedroom nightstand; place the alarm clock onto the wiped West Bedroom nightstand; place the box of tissues and hardback book onto the wiped West Bedroom desk; store the digital camera inside the wiped tall Central Study storage cabinet and close its doors; and leave the wooden utility tray resting on the Central Study coffee table, the West Bedroom bed, the West Bedroom desk, or the East Bedroom bed.",
  "Finish with no object held."
 ],
